thub.com/Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","login":"Nintorch","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679#pullrequestreview-3533571698","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-03T07:29:47Z"},{"id":3535656570,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SvdZ6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, I can't get gyro or accelerometer to be enabled on a DualSense Edge (wired) on Linux. I've tried both bundled SDL and system SDL. It works on a standard DualSense (wired) though.\r\n\r\nWired Switch Pro Controller also works, but it continuously drifts upwards when I do nothing (I've tried unplugging and replugging the controller several times). This didn't occur on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967#pullrequestreview-3012257702.\r\n\r\nI'll test this on Windows/macOS later today.\r\n\r\n**Edit:** DualSense and DualSense Edge (wired) both work on Windows 11 24H2. I can't get the Switch Pro Controller to be recognized at all though (not specific to this PR). Note that if you unplug the controller during gameplay, the last gyro motion will be retained, which results in the view continuously drifting off until you replug the controller and re-enable gyro.\r\n\r\nmacOS also works with DualSense and DualSense Edge (wired), but the Switch Pro Controller isn't recognized at all either.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [physics_interpolation_gyro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23911248/physics_interpolation_gyro.zip) (modified from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967#pullrequestreview-3012257702 to only test features available in this PR)\r\n\r\nAlso, the gyro direction appears to be inverted compared to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967#pullrequestreview-3012257702. In the project I linked, both X and Y aiming are inverted with all controllers. Is that intended?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679#pullrequestreview-3535656570","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-03T15:42:42Z"},{"id":3535714341,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Svrgl","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679#pullrequestreview-3535714341","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111679","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-03T15:46:54Z"},{"id":3535846491,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SwLxb","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?u=f6c14ec512c7cd33f8d109f121e89b7e60e42f38&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":